@startuml RF46_Sequencia
title RF46 — Gerar assets criativos do FashionAI por meio do FAI Creative Engine e serviços Adobe\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais (Background Studio / selos) e Creative Engine planejado
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as U
participant "Frontend\nbackground-studio.tsx" as FE
participant "BackgroundController" as C
participant "BackgroundStudioService" as S
participant "AiEngine (RF24)" as AI
participant "ImageGenerationPort\n(ReplicateImageGenerationAdapter;\nAdobe Firefly <<planejado>>)" as P
participant "MediaService\n(→ MediaStoragePort)" as ST
participant "FAI Creative Engine\n<<planejado>>" as CE #FAFAFA
database "MySQL" as DB

U -> FE: prompt + direção + era + alvo
FE -> C: GET /api/backgrounds/catalog
C -> S: catalog()
S -> DB: SELECT asset_presets
C --> FE: 200 presets AURA/materiais + imageGenerationAvailable
FE -> C: POST /api/backgrounds/art (ArtRequest)
C -> S: generateArt(user, req)
S -> AI: execute(BACKGROUND_GENERATOR, protectedNames, steps)
loop cada provedor disponível (fallback)
  AI -> P: generate(prompt, negativePrompt, 896, 1344)
  P --> AI: ProviderImage(bytes, costUsd, provider)
end
alt nenhum provedor respondeu
  AI --> S: AiOutcome(value=null)
  S -> DB: SELECT asset_presets (auraPresets)
  S --> FE: 200 FALLBACK_GALLERY + suggestions
else imagem gerada
  AI --> S: AiOutcome(bytes, provider, latencyMs, costUsd)
  S -> ST: put(users/{id}/backgrounds/{uuid}.png)
  S -> DB: INSERT photos (register: PhotoOrigin.BACKGROUND_STUDIO, prompt, provider)
  S --> FE: 200 READY + url
end
U -> FE: aplicar ao card
FE -> C: PUT /api/pieces/{id}/background
C -> S: savePiece(user, pieceId, cfg)
S -> DB: UPDATE wardrobe_items.background_config_json (com rev)
note right of S: a imagem canônica da peça (RF45) não muda:\no card só sobrepõe a peça ao fundo
opt <<planejado>> — não implementado, conforme Trello
  FE -> CE: CreativeRequest (tipo BADGE | PROFILE_COVER | FLAIR_CARD…, template)
  CE -> DB: INSERT pipeline_jobs (PENDING)
  CE --> FE: 202 jobId (sem HTTP bloqueante)
  CE -> CE: TemplateResolver + composição com piece_product_front.png (RF45)
  CE -> DB: CreativeAsset + AssetVersion + provenance; job COMPLETED | REQUIRES_REVIEW
end
@enduml
